# Thieves Guild: Big Helende's jobs, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub, Sadrith Mora (Helende = 058C3F4A). Offered under
# "jobs" in a fixed order: potion recipe (the job puts it in Anis Seloth's crate; Tusamircil at Wolverine Hall takes
# it, 50), Grandmaster's Retort, hire a wizard (Arielle Phiencel at Wolverine Hall: 50, four raw ebony 70), Redoran
# Cooking Secrets, Felen Maryon's staff ("I'm interested." 20; sold, 6: 100).
# AddItem stands in for the thefts and finds; the recipe leaves the crate it was put in. Reputation 5 each: 25, 80
# with Habasi's and Aengoth's.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tg_potion_recipe
run
player->PositionCell -317 -400 391 0 "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub" == 1
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask jobs
ask potion recipe
expect GetJournalIndex TG_CookbookAlchemy == 10
bye
run
"crate_01_anis seloth"->RemoveItem bk_dispelrecipe_tgca 1
player->AddItem bk_dispelrecipe_tgca 1
player->PositionCell -76 700 81 0 "Sadrith Mora, Wolverine Hall: Mage's Guild"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Wolverine Hall: Mage's Guild" == 1
approach 0575D6E5
talk tusamircil
ask potion recipe
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_CookbookAlchemy == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell -317 -400 391 0 "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub" == 1
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask potion recipe
expect GetJournalIndex TG_CookbookAlchemy == 100
bye
end

case tg_retort
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask jobs
ask Grandmaster's Retort
expect GetJournalIndex TG_GrandmasterRetort == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem Apparatus_G_Retort_01 1
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask Grandmaster's Retort
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_GrandmasterRetort == 100
bye
end

case tg_hire_wizard
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask jobs
ask hire a wizard
expect GetJournalIndex TG_SadrithMoraDefenses == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem Ingred_Raw_Ebony_01 4
player->PositionCell 241 350 86 0 "Sadrith Mora, Wolverine Hall: Mage's Guild"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Wolverine Hall: Mage's Guild" == 1
approach 05661C92
talk arielle phiencel
ask hire a wizard
expect GetJournalIndex TG_SadrithMoraDefenses == 50
ask hire a wizard
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_SadrithMoraDefenses == 70
bye
run
player->PositionCell -317 -400 391 0 "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub" == 1
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask hire a wizard
expect GetJournalIndex TG_SadrithMoraDefenses == 100
bye
end

case tg_redoran_cookbook
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask jobs
ask Redoran Cooking Secrets
expect GetJournalIndex TG_RedoranCookbook == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem bk_RedoranCookingSecrets 1
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask Redoran Cooking Secrets
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_RedoranCookbook == 100
bye
end

case tg_ebony_staff
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask jobs
ask Felen Maryon's staff
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EbonyStaff == 20
bye
run
player->AddItem "ebony staff caper" 1
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask Felen Maryon's staff
choose 6
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EbonyStaff == 100
bye
end

# 80 reputation meets rank 7 (Ringleader: 80).
case tg_helende_advancement
approach 058C3F4A
talk big helende
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank "Thieves Guild" == 7
bye
end
